<title>UK: Recent highs and lows for major currencies.</title>
<headline>Recent highs and lows for major currencies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the recent highs or lows for major currencies as of European afternoon trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>** DOLLAR/MARK -- 1.8325, highest since August 1991</p>
<p>(reached July 23, 1997).</p>
<p>** DOLLAR/YEN -- 127.46, highest since August 1992, (May 1,</p>
<p>1997).</p>
<p>			-- 110.52, lowest since September 1996, (June</p>
<p>11, 1997).</p>
<p>** STERLING/MARK -- 3.0878, highest since September 1989</p>
<p>(July 23, 1997)</p>
<p>** STERLING/DOLLAR -- 1.6986, highest since January 1997</p>
<p>(July 11, 1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/YEN -- 62.93, lowest since July 1995 (July 23, 1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/SWISS -- 0.8108, lowest since August 1996 (July 23,</p>
<p>1997)</p>
<p>** DOLLAR/SWISS -- 1.4900 (July 23, 1997), highest since</p>
<p>March 1997 when dollar/Swiss reached 1.4923, its highest since</p>
<p>January 1994.</p>
<p>** ECU/MARK -- 1.9825, highest since September 1992 (July</p>
<p>23, 1997)</p>
<p>** ECU/DOLLAR -- 1.0815, lowest since August 1993 (July 23,</p>
<p>1997)</p>
<p>** PUNT/MARK -- 2.7118, highest since at least July 1993</p>
<p>(July 14, 1997)</p>
<p>** PUNT/STERLING -- 0.8770, lowest in seven years, (July 23,</p>
<p>1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/LIRA -- 969.30, lowest since January 1997 (July 11,</p>
<p>1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/SWEDISH CROWN -- 4.2795, lowest since October 1992</p>
<p>(July 23, 1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/NORWEGIAN CROWN -- 4.1030, lowest since May 1997</p>
<p>(July 23, 1997)</p>
<p>** MARK/MARKKA -- 2.9400, lowest since February 1997 (July</p>
<p>23, 1997)</p>
</text>
